{"id":"DfnKmAPIoAW","title":"Video by louis_rlee","description":"The OpenCode team just open-sourced a UI framework your AI agent can actually see.\n\nRune → native desktop apps in Rust, rendered on the GPU.\nNo Electron. No bundled browser.\n\nThe part that matters: every app runs headless.\nYour agent (Claude Code, Codex, OpenCode) can:\n→ render the app to a PNG\n→ read the full element tree\n→ click and type through it with scripts\n\nSo it builds the UI, looks at it, tests it and fixes it. On its own.\n\nPre-release, MIT licensed. macOS, Windows, Linux (web is experimental).\n\nComment RUNE and I’ll DM you the repo + the prompt to build your first app.\n\nOne of these every day → follow @louis_rlee\n\n#rust #opensource #aiagents #claudecode #devtools","channel":"louis_rlee","uploader_id":"64480625398","uploader":"Louis Raillé","timestamp":1794423131,"like_count":1513,"comment_count":185,"http_headers":{"Referer":"https://www.instagram.com/"},"comments":[{"author":"jackfusion1","author_id":"39363458","id":"17954043306053477","text":"Rune","timestamp":1794624533,"like_count":0},{"author":"alessandro_sorelli","author_id":"9033309179","id":"18359196175169499","text":"Rune","timestamp":1794620919,"like_count":0},{"author":"sigaocapivas","author_id":"287930023","id":"18191044414407844","text":"Rune","timestamp":1794613500,"like_count":0},{"author":"gerondtaci","author_id":"7200926386","id":"18100616393535790","text":"Rune","timestamp":1794601870,"like_count":0},{"author":"sulaimaan_wesley_blake","author_id":"67093972867","id":"18133803295862913","text":"Rune","timestamp":1794583650,"like_count":0},{"author":"_cxrlxs1","author_id":"62223747710","id":"17957432886271267","text":"Rune","timestamp":1794565155,"like_count":0},{"author":"_cxrlxs1","author_id":"62223747710","id":"18137695774730381","text":"rune","timestamp":1794565136,"like_count":0},{"author":"yankovprokoviev","author_id":"76479053842","id":"18122986004066568","text":"Another bullshit that can't give me mon